---

## 📌 Introduction
This project analyzes **fake vs legitimate job postings** using **Power BI**.  
It helps detect **fraudulent hiring patterns, remote job risks, company credibility issues, and recruitment trends** through interactive dashboards and visual analytics.

---

## 🛠️ Tools Used
- 📊 Power BI  
- 🔄 Power Query  
- 📐 DAX (Data Analysis Expressions)  

---

## 🧠 Skills Applied
- 🧹 Data Cleaning  
- 🔧 Data Transformation  
- 📊 KPI Design  
- 📈 Data Visualization  
- 📊 Dashboard Development  
- 🚨 Fraud Pattern Analysis  
- 💼 Business Intelligence  
- 📖 Data Storytelling  

---

## 📊 Dashboard Overview

### 🧭 Page 1 — Executive Overview
- 📌 Total job postings  
- ⚖️ Fake vs Real job distribution  
- 🏭 Industry-wise fake job analysis  
- 🏠 Remote vs On-site analysis  
- 📊 High-level recruitment insights  

---

### 🔍 Page 2 — Fraud & Hiring Insights
- 🏢 Company credibility analysis  
- 📝 Job description length analysis  
- 👔 Employment type distribution  
- 🎯 Experience level trends  
- 🌍 Geographic hiring distribution  

---

## 💡 Key Learnings
- 📊 Built interactive Power BI dashboards  
- 🔄 Data cleaning using Power Query  
- 📐 Created DAX measures for KPIs  
- 🚨 Learned fraud detection patterns  
- 📖 Improved storytelling through data visualization  

---

## 🚀 Future Improvements
- 🤖 Machine learning-based fraud prediction  
- 💰 Salary anomaly detection  
- 🔗 Real-time job data integration  
- 🧠 NLP-based job description analysis  

---

## 🎯 Conclusion
This project demonstrates how **Power BI + Data Analytics** can be used to identify suspicious job postings, understand hiring behavior, and generate actionable business insights.

